00:03:11.787 --> 00:03:13.566
Someone told me you should
face the oncoming traffic

00:03:13.566 --> 00:03:15.598
so you can see a car about to hit you.

00:03:15.598 --> 00:03:19.046
- I'd say, side of the road
facing oncoming traffic.

00:03:19.046 --> 00:03:21.713
